# cmd.exe requires CRLF. Restore-Native-Codex.cmd shipped with LF-only endings
# and never ran: the parser ate the first characters of each line, turning
# `setlocal` into `ocal` and `rem` into `m`, and the script exited 255 having
# done nothing. That is the escape hatch, so it failed exactly when it was
# needed. Keep these files CRLF in the working tree regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Everything else stays LF in the repository.
* text=auto
